<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Unibanco Seguros H1 net higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Unibanco Seguros H1 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian insurance company Unibanco Seguros issued the following statement on its first half results.</p>
<p>		  H1 1996			  H1 1995</p>
<p>    shr	 63.76 reais		    60.19 reais</p>
<p>    net	 70.7 million			 24.8 million</p>
<p>    premiums  250.7 million			177 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Share profit figures provided in lots of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 2324411.</p>
</text>
